# ==============================================================================
# Scanner Simulator - Firebase Authentication Configuration
#
# To permanently connect Firebase for all users and enable live email inbox delivery:
# 1. Open Google Firebase Console (https://console.firebase.google.com/)
# 2. Select or create your project -> Click "Authentication" -> "Get started"
# 3. Enable the "Email/Password" sign-in method
# 4. In Project Settings (gear icon) -> "General" -> "Your apps", create or select your Web app
# 5. Copy the configuration values into your .env file:
# ==============================================================================

VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id_here
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_project_id_here.firebaseapp.com
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_project_id_here.appspot.com
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=your_messaging_sender_id_here
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=your_app_id_here
